{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L6--7 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: ascend_breakable_shaft\n- L10--11 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: ascend_with_ceiling_hazards\n- L14--15 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: ascend_with_ceiling_hazards\n- L18--19 `def play_level_4(env):`; calls: navigate_consumable_gravity_switches\n- L22--26 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: ascend_with_ceiling_hazards, navigate_consumable_gravity_switches\n\n## legs.py\n- L8--58 `def ascend_breakable_shaft(env, max_moves=60, origin=(15, 3), cell=6, shape=(10, 7)):` — Route an upward-floating avatar through a shaft, clearing yellow tiles.; calls: any, arr, connected_components, int, len, next, range, round, safe_step, set\n- L61--138 `def ascend_with_ceiling_hazards(env, max_moves=180, origin=(15, 3), cell=6, shape=(10, 7), toggle_color=None):` — Rise through breakable ceilings, staging sideways before a fatal ascent.; calls: arr, bool, connected_components, deque, enumerate, int, len, range, round, safe_step, +1\n- L141--228 `def navigate_consumable_gravity_switches(env, max_moves=160, origin=(15, 3), cell=6, shape=(10, 7), turn_back_after=None):` — Descend a shaft using one-use gravity reversals and breakable supports.; calls: any, arr, connected_components, deque, enumerate, int, isinstance, len, range, round, +2\n\n## perception.py\n- L23--36 `class Blob:`; calls: dataclass\n- L39--40 `def arr(frame) -> np.ndarray:`\n- L43--45 `def color_counts(frame) -> Dict[int, int]:`; calls: arr, int, zip\n- L48--79 `def connected_components(frame, colors: Optional[Iterable[int]] = None, min_area: int = 1) -> List[Blob]:`; calls: Blob, arr, int, len, max, min, range, sorted, sum\n- L82--89 `def block_signatures(frame, cell: int = 4) -> Dict[Tuple[int, int],