rd camera offset (centers y=5 mod 6 versus y=3 mod 6 upward).\n- `probe_search.py`: bounded exploratory clone search; its fixed-origin sampler\n  misses outlined purple tiles during descent, so it is not solver evidence.\n\nThe navigation leg now infers tile alignment from avatar centroid and includes\npurple toggle masks. It rejects immediate clone-fatal moves and marks their\nviewport departure lane unsafe in projected plans, allowing support staging\ninstead of repeatedly choosing a fatal unseen fall. The ascent leg can seek a\nhigher reachable ledge when the visible top row cannot be reached.\nMD'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
